culty. Provide evidence: C can make correct decisions quickly, creates positive atmosphere, but difficulty communicating ideas and egocentric. We can weigh that.\n\nWe need to state our vote. Let's vote Candidate C.\n\nProvide public message: reference Agent 1's recommendation, note D's concerns, present C's strengths, argue C's overall fit better.\n\nProceed."}
